rincess meets Snow White at her teahouse in the forest, and while the girls get acquainted, the devil kidnaps them both.<br>\n<br>\n(Source: The Anime Encyclopedia by Jonathan Clements and Helen McCarthy)", "startDate": {"year": 1981, "month": 3}, "endDate": {"year": 1981, "month": 3}, "season": "WINTER", "seasonYear": 1981, "episodes": 1, "duration": 30, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": [{"name": "Fairy Tale", "rank": 30, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Shoujo", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 169017, "title": {"romaji": "Kagirinaki Rakuen", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "An 8mm animation that was produced by Harada during his high school years.", "startDate": {"year": 1981, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1981, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 41, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Drama", "Horror", "Psychological"], "tags": [{"name": "Coming of Age", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Class Struggle", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Philosophy", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Politics", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Bullying", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Suicide", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "School", "rank": 40, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 169042, "title": {"romaji": "Apple Papple Princess", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video for the song <i>Apple Papple Princess</i> by Mariya Takeuchi that was featured on NHK's Minna no Uta program.", "startDate": {"year": 1981, "month": 12}, "endDate": {"year": 1981, "month": 12}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 169458, "title": {"romaji": "Futari de Hanbunko", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video for the song <i>Futari de Hanbunko</i> by Mitsuko Horie, Mamoru Ichiba, Titine & Children Chorus, and the Morinoki Jidou Gasshoudan that was featured on NHK's Minna no Uta program. The song was featured as the ending for <i>Meiken Jolie</i>. The video features characters from the series, but it is entirely new animation.", "startDate": {"year": 1981, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 1981, "month": 8}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Adventure"], "tags": []}, {"id": 169460, "title": {"romaji": "Don Quixote", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video for the song <i>Don Quixote</i> by Isao Sasaki that was featured on NHK's Minna no Uta program.", "startDate": {"year": 1981, "month": 2}, "endDate": {"year": 1981, "month": 2}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 169753, "title": {"romaji": "Wanwan Kaji da Wan", "english": null}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "A short film about fire safety with a twist involving an alien in his spaceship working with the neighborhood kids.", "startDate": {"year": 1981, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1981, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 18, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 170506, "title": {"romaji": "Megemege Rumba", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video for the song <i>Megemege Rumba</i> by Shiori that was featured on NHK's Minna no Uta program.", "startDate": {"year": 1981, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 1981, "month": 10}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 170569, "title": {"romaji": "Dixie Wonderland", "english": 